<title>FRANCE: Suez says real estate problems are largely behind.</title>
<headline>Suez says real estate problems are largely behind.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Suez chairman Gerard Mestrallet said on Wednesday that the company's real estate problems were largely behind.</p>
<p>&quot;The page on real estate has been largely turned...Our remaining commitments, which we manage at our best, are no longer an obstacle to the restructuring and development of our group,&quot; he told a shareholders' meeting. </p>
<p>He  said the group's commitments to the  real estate sector were 4.8 billion francs at the start of 1997.</p>
</text>
